   "text": "Kaplan International College London - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nKaplan International College London\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nKIC London has been helping students on their path to university for over 10 years. In that time, we’ve grown a lot and learned what is most important to international students like you. As an international student, you might need, or benefit from, a pathway course before you start your degree at university. You can study a pathway course at Kaplan International College (KIC) London, and boost your academic skills and English language level to gain entry to a bachelor’s or master’s degree in the UK.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:34\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 05:28\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £23,340.00\nMin: £16,750.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n56%\n3,976 of 7,100 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1938\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.kaplanpathways.com/where-to-study/kaplan-international-college-london/accommodation/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XPjBCvg67Xc\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
